ound \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> needle <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span>\n            <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"no dice!<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw1\">using</span> CD <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/complex\"><span class=\"kw1480\">std::<span class=\"me2\">complex</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">double</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/vector\"><span class=\"kw1277\">std::<span class=\"me2\">vector</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CD<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> nums<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>, <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">3</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>, <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">4</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>, <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">4</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">3</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> cmpz <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>CD x, CD y<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">{</span> <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> abs<span class=\"br0\">(</span>x<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> abs<span class=\"br0\">(</span>y<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n   